#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You would typically use &krfb; with the &kde; <acronym>VNC</acronym> client, "
"which is &krdc;, since it closely matches the special features of &krfb;."
msgstr ""
"Obično koristite &krfb; sa &kde; <acronym>VNC</acronym> klijentom, što je i "
"&krdc;, jer najbliže odgovara posebnim karakteristikama &krfb;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krfb; doesn't require you to start a new X session - it can share the "
"current session. This makes it very useful when you want someone to help you "
"perform a task."
msgstr ""
"&krfb; ne zahtjeva od vas da bi ste započeli novih X sesija - možete "
"podijeliti trenutne sesije. To ga čini vrlo korisnim kada želite nekoga da "
"vam pomogne da obavite neki zadatak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please report any problems or feature requests to the &kde; mailing lists or "
"file a bug at <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde.org\">http://bugs.kde.org</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Molim Vas da prijavite bilo kakve probleme ili zahtjeve funkcionalnosti "
"&kde; listi mail-ova ili prijavite problem na <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde."
"org\">http://bugs.kde.org</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Remote Frame Buffer protocol"
msgstr "Remote Frame Buffer protokol"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter provides a brief description of the Remote Frame Buffer "
"protocol used by &krfb; and by other compatible systems. If you are already "
"familiar with Remote Frame Buffer, you can safely skip this chapter."
msgstr ""
"Ovo poglavlje daje kratak opis Remote Frame Buffer protokola korišten u "
"&krfb; i drugim kompatibilnim sistemima. Ukoliko ste već upoznati sa Remote "
"Frame Buffer protokolom, možete preskočiti ovo poglavlje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The high level implementation of a system using the Remote Frame Buffer "
"protocol is known as Virtual Network Computer, or more often just as "
"<acronym>VNC</acronym>."
msgstr ""
"Visoki nivo implementacije sistema koji korisni Remote Frame Buffer protokol "
"je poznat kao Virtual Network Computer, ili češće samo kao <acronym>VNC</"
"acronym>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remote Frame Buffer (or <acronym>RFB</acronym> for short) is a simple "
"protocol for remote access to graphical user interfaces. It works at the "
"frame-buffer level, which roughly corresponds to the rendered screen image, "
"which means that it can be applied to all windowing systems (including X11, "
"&MacOS; and &Microsoft; &Windows;). Remote Frame Buffer applications exist "
"for many platforms, and can often be freely re-distributed."
msgstr ""
"Remote Frame Buffer (ili kraće <acronym>RFB</acronym>) je jednostavan "
"protokol za daljinski pristup grafičkog korisničkog interfejsa. Ona radi na "
"nivou frame-buffera, što približno odgovara slici na ekranu, što znači da se "
"može primijeniti na sve sisteme (ukuljučujući X11, &MacOS; and &Microsoft; "
"&Windows;). Remote Frame Buffer aplikacije postoje za mnoge platforme, i "
"također mogu se besplatno re-distribuirati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the Remote Frame Buffer protocol, the application that runs on the "
"machine where the user sits (containing the display, keyboard and pointer) "
"is called the client. The application that runs on the machine where the "
"framebuffer is located (which is running the windowing system and "
"applications that the user is remotely controlling) is called the server. "
"&krfb; is the &kde; server for the Remote Frame Buffer protocol. &krdc; is "
"the &kde; client for the Remote Frame Buffer protocol."
msgstr ""
"U Remote Frame Buffer protokolu, aplikacija koja radi na uređaju gdje je "
"korisnik (sadrži monitor, tastaturu i miš) se naziva klijent. Aplikacija "
"koja radi na uređajuu na kojem se nalazi Framebuffer (na kojoj je pokrenut "
"sistem i aplikacije kojima korisnik vrši daljinsku kontrolu) naziva se "
"server. &krfb; je &kde; server za Remote Frame Buffer protokool. &krdc; je "
"&kde; klijent za Remote Frame Buffer protokol."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It takes a reasonable amount of network traffic to send an image of the "
"framebuffer, so Remote Frame Buffer works best over high bandwidth links, "
"such as a local area network. It is still possible to use &krfb; over other "
"links, but performance is unlikely to be as good."
msgstr ""
"Potrebno je imati razumnu količinu mrežnog prometa da biste poslali sliku o "
"Framebufferu, Remote Frame Buffer najbolje radi preko visoko propusnih veza, "
"kao što su lokalne mreže. Ipak je moguće koristiti &krfb; u odnosu na druge "
"veze, ali učinak je malo vjerovatno dobar."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &krfb;"
msgstr "Upotreba &krfb;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is very easy to use &krfb; - it has a simple interface, as shown in the "
"screenshot below."
msgstr ""
"To je vrlo jednostavan za korištenje &krfb; - ima jednostavan interfejs, kao "
"što je prikazano na slici ispod."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &krfb;"
msgstr "Ovdje je slika zaslona &krdc;-a"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "&krfb; main window"
msgstr "&krfb; glavni prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you want to allow someone to access your desktop, you can create an "
"personal invitation using the <guibutton>New Personal Invitation...</"
"guibutton> button, which will bring up a window containing the information "
"needed to access your desktop. An example is shown below."
msgstr ""
"Kada želite dozvoliti nekome za pristup vašoj radnoj povrsini , možete "
"kreirati osobni poziv koristeći dugme <guibutton>Novi lični poziv...</"
"guibutton>, što će dovesti do prozora koji sadrži informacije koje su "
"potrebne za pristup radnoj površini. Primjer je prikazan ispod."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Example &krfb; personal invitation</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Primjer &krfb; ličnog poziva</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Example &krfb; personal invitation</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Primjer &krfb; ličnog poziva</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To increase security, the invitation is only valid for an hour after it is "
"created, and of course the person connecting has to have the correct "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Da bi se povećala sigurnost, poziv vrijedi samo sat vremena nakon što je "
"stvoren, i naravno osoba koja se povezuje mora imati ispravnu šifru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since you may want to invite someone to access your desktop by email, &krfb; "
"can create invitations as email messages. You can create such an invitation "
"using the <guibutton>New Email Invitation...</guibutton> button on the "
"&krfb; main window. This will usually bring up an email message that looks "
"like the following, ready for you to type in the email address of the person "
"you are sending the invitation to."
msgstr ""
"Obzirom da želite pozvati nekoga da pristupi vašoj radnoj površini putem e-"
"maila, &krfb; možete kreirati pozivnice koje su e-mail poruke. Takav poziv "
"možete kreirati pomoću dugmeta <guibutton>Nova Email pozivnica...</"
"guibutton> na &krfb; glavnom prozoru. Ovo će obično dovesti do email poruke "
"koja izgleda ovako, spremna za vas, unesite email adresu osobe kojoj želite "
"poslati poziv."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Example &krfb; email invitation</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Primjer &krfb; email pozivnice</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Example &krfb; email invitation</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Primjer &krfb; email pozivnice</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krfb; will warn you about the security implications of sending this "
"information across an insecure link. You must heed those warnings."
msgstr ""
"&krfb; će vas upozoriti o sigurnosti posljedica slanja ove informacije preko "
"nesigurne veze. Morate obratiti pažnju na ova upozorenja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you cannot encrypt the email (or otherwise secure the link), sending "
"invitations by email is a very serious security risk, since anyone can read "
"the password and address from the email as it passes over the network. This "
"means that they can potentially take control of your machine."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne možete šifrirati emailove (ili na drugi način osigurati vezu), slanje "
"pozivnice putem emaila je vrlo ozbiljan sigurnosni rizik, jer bilo ko može "
"pročitati lozinku i adresu emaila dok prolazi putem mreže. To potencijalno "
"znači da neko može preuzeti kontrolu vašeg uređaja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you cannot encrypt the email message, it may be better to use a personal "
"invitation, telephone the person you are giving access to, verify the "
"identity of that person, and provide the required invitation information "
"that way."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ne možete šifrirati mail poruke, možda je bolje da koristi osobni "
"telefonski poziv, pozovite osobu kojoj dajete pristup, provjeriti identitet "
"te osobe, i na taj način dajte tražene informacije."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing &krfb; invitations"
msgstr "Upravljanje &krfb; pozivnicama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Having created an invitation (either a personal invitation or one that was "
"sent by email), &krfb; main window allows you to delete existing "
"invitations. To just delete one of the invitations, select it with the mouse "
"(it should become highlighted), and then select the <guibutton>Delete</"
"guibutton>. To delete all invitations, just select the <guibutton>Delete "
"All</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što je stvorena pozivnica (ili lični poziv ili onaj koji je poslao e-"
"mail), i krfb; glavni prozor vam omogućava brisanje postojećih pozivnica. Da "
"biste izbrisali samo jednu od pozivnica, odaberite je s mišem (time bi "
"trebala postati istaknuta), a zatim odaberite <guibutton>Obriši</guibutton>. "
"Za brisanje svih pozivnica kliknite na dugme <guibutton>Obriši sve</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quit &krfb;"
msgstr "Izlaz &krfb;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you close the &krfb; main window the server keeps running, which is "
"indicated by an icon in the system tray. To stop &krfb; right click on the "
"icon in the systems tray and select <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko zatvorite &krfb; glavni prozor, server će i dalje raditi, što je "
"označeno ikonom u sistemskoj traci. Da bi ste zaustavili &krfb; desni klik "
"na ikonu u sistemskoj traci i odaberite <guimenuitem>Izlaz</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &krfb;"
msgstr "Konfiguracija &krfb;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In addition to the main &krfb; interface shown and described above, you can "
"also control &krfb; using the <guibutton>Configure...</guibutton> on the "
"&krfb; main window. The &krfb; configuration has two pages, as shown in the "
"screenshot below:"
msgstr ""
"Osim glavnog &krfb; interfejsa prikazanog i opisanog gore, također možete "
"kontrolirati &krfb; korišteći <guibutton>Konfiguracije...</guibutton> na "
"&krfb; glavnom prozoru. &krfb; konfiguracije su prikazane na dvije stranice, "
"kao što je prikazano na slici ispod:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Network</guilabel> page allows control over the port that "
"&krfb; uses, as shown below."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Mrežna</guilabel> strana dopušta kontrolu nad portom koji koristi "
"&krfb;, kao što je prikazano u nastavku."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&krfb; Configuration (Network page)</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&krfb; Konfiguracija (mrežne strane)</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&krfb; Configuration (Network page)</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&krfb; Konfiguracija (mrežne strane)</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Announce service on the network</guilabel> checkbox controls "
"whether &krfb; announces invitations over the network using Service Location "
"Protocol. This is normally a good idea, but only works really well with a "
"Service Location Protocol aware client, such as &krdc;."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Najavite uslugu na mreži</guilabel> potvrdite da li kontroliše "
"&krfb; pozivnice preko mreže koristeći Service Location Protokol. Ovo je "
"obično dobra ideja, ali jako dobro  radi sa Service Location Protokolom "
"posebnih klijenata, kao što je &krdc;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you select the <guilabel>Use default port</guilabel> checkbox, then "
"&krfb; will locate a suitable port, and invitations will match this port. If "
"you deselect this checkbox, you can specify a particular port. Specifying a "
"particular port may be useful if you are using port-forwarding on the "
"firewall. Note that if Service Location Protocol is turned on, this will "
"automatically deal with identifying the correct port."
msgstr ""
"Ako odaberete <guilabel>Koristi zadani port</guilabel>, onda će &krfb; "
"locirati odgovarajući port, a pozivnice će odgovarati preko tog porta. Ako "
"poništite ovu potvrdu možete odabrati odgovarajući port. Navođenje "
"odgovarajuceg porta može biti korisno ako koristite port-forwarding na "
"firewall-u. Imajte na umu ukoliko je Service Location Protocol uključen, to "
"će automatski dobavljati identifikacije na ispravan port."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Security</guilabel> page allows you configure settings related "
"to access to the &krfb; server."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Bezbjednost</guilabel> stranica koja vam omogućava podešavanje "
"posavki koje se odnose na pristup &krfb; serveru."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&krfb; Configuration (Security page)</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&krfb; Konfiguracija (sigurnosne stranice)</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&krfb; Configuration (Security page)</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&krfb; Konfiguracija (sigurnosne stranice)</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Allow uninvited connections</guilabel> check box controls "
"whether &krfb; allows connection without an invitation. If uninvited "
"connections are allowed, then you should probably specify a password. You "
"can also use the check boxes here to choose whether you have to confirm the "
"connection before it proceeds, and whether the person connecting can control "
"the desktop, or only view."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Dopusti nepozvane veze</guilabel> polje za potvrdu kontrole da li "
"&krfb; omogućuje povezivanje bez pozivnice. Ako su dozvoljene nepozvane "
"veze, onda bi vjerojatno trebalo odrediti šifru. Također možete koristiti "
"potvrdne okvire da izabere da li treba da potvrdite vezu prije nego što se "
"nastavlja, i da li je osoba s kojom je povezivanje može kontrolirati radnu "
"površinu, ili samo posmatranje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the machine is a workstation, and you choose to allow uninvited "
"connections, you probably want to select the <guilabel>Ask before accepting "
"connections </guilabel>. Conversely, if the machine is a server and you are "
"using &krfb; for remote administration, you probably want to deselect this "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko je uređaj workstation, i dopustite nepozvane veze , vjerovatno "
"želite odabrati <guilabel>Pitaj prije prihvatanja veze</guilabel>. Nasuprot "
"tome, ukoliko je uređaj server i koristi &krfb; za udaljenu administraciju, "
"vjerovatno želite da poništite ovu opciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krfb; uses the normal <acronym>RFB</acronym> password system, which does "
"not transfer your password in the clear across the network. Instead, it uses "
"a challenge-response system. This is reasonably secure, as long as the "
"password is securely guarded."
msgstr ""
"&krfb; koristi normalnu <acronym>RFB</acronym> sistemsku šifru, koja se ne "
"prenosi preko mreže. Umjesti toga koristi sistem izazov-odgovor. To je "
"bezbjedno, dok je lozinka sigurno čuvana."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:382
#, no-c-format
msgid "What happens when someone connects to &krfb;"
msgstr "Što se događa kada neko povezuje sa &krfb;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When someone connects to &krfb; on your machine, you will get a pop-up "
"notification that looks like the following screenshot, unless you are "
"accepting uninvited connections without warning."
msgstr ""
"Kada neko povezuje &krfb; na tvoj uređaj, dobit ćete pop-up notifikaciju "
"koja izgleda kao sljedeći screenshot, osim ako se prihvate nepozvane veze "
"bez upozorenja."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&krfb; Connection Window</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&krfb; Prozor za povezivanje</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&krfb; Connection Window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&krfb; Prozor za povezivanje</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you <guibutton>Accept Connection</guibutton>, the client can proceed to "
"authenticate (which requires the correct password for a personal invitation "
"or email invitation). If you <guibutton>Refuse Connection</guibutton>, then "
"the attempt to connect will be terminated."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko <guibutton>Prihvatite vezu</guibutton>, klijent može nastaviti "
"autentifikaciju (koja zahtjeva ispravnu šifru za lični poziv ili email "
"pozivnicu). Ukoliko <guibutton>Odbijete vezu</guibutton>, onda će pokušaj da "
"se povežete biti prekinut."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Allow remote user to control keyboard and mouse</guilabel> "
"check box determines whether this client can only observe, or can take "
"control of your machine."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Dopustite udaljenom korisniku kontrolu tastature i miša</guilabel> "
"check box-om određujete da li klijent može samo posmatrati ili može preuzeti "
"kontrolu vašeg uređaja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the client connection is successful, and used the password from a "
"personal invitation or email invitation, then that invitation is deleted and "
"cannot be used again. You will also get a small pop-up window in the dock, "
"that shows that the connection has been made."
msgstr ""
"Ako je veza sa klijentom uspješna i korišten je lični poziv ili email "
"pozivnica, onda se taj poziv briše i ne može se ponovno koristiti.  Također "
"ćete dobiti mali pop-up prozor koji prikazuje da je veza uspješno "
"uspostavljena."

